    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "No birthday is "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "complete",
            "ref": "v-complete"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " without a birthday cake. But where does eating cake on a birthday come from? And who started to put candles on top?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Round cakes with candles"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Ancient Greeks",
            "zh": "古希腊人"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " made round cakes and put candles on them to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "honour",
            "ref": "v-honour"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Artemis*, the moon goddess. A round cake looks like the moon. The candles on top give off light, just like the moon! What a clever idea!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The first real birthday cake"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The first real birthday cake was for the birthdays of children in Germany "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "during",
            "ref": "v-during"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the Middle Ages*. For the parties, children would get cakes with candles. One candle for each year they had lived, and an "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "extra",
            "ref": "v-extra"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " one for the year to come!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h3",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Sweet, cheap and nice cakes"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Birthday cakes haven’t always been as delicious as they are now. Sugar was very expensive, so sweet cakes were only for the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "rich",
            "ref": "v-rich"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Thanks to the Industrial Revolution*, sugar became much cheaper, and so did sweet cakes. Everyone could now enjoy a sweet birthday cake!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "n1",
        "type": "note",
        "title": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Did you know?"
          }
        ],
        "content": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "* 阿尔忒弥斯（Artemis）是古希腊神话中的月亮女神和狩猎女神。"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "* 中世纪（the Middle Ages）指欧洲历史上的一段时期，从公元5世纪后期到公元15世纪中期。"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "* 工业革命（the Industrial Revolution）指18及19世纪欧美使用机器、工业迅速发展的阶段。"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
